      <memberdef kind="function" id="classthemis_1_1_search_highlighter_1aecea2125d2c4ea086405afb370e81dff" prot="public" static="yes" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>std::string</type>
        <definition>std::string themis::SearchHighlighter::applyHighlight</definition>
        <argsstring>(const std::string &amp;text, const std::vector&lt; std::pair&lt; size_t, size_t &gt; &gt; &amp;offsets, const std::string &amp;open_tag, const std::string &amp;close_tag)</argsstring>
        <name>applyHighlight</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::SearchHighlighter::applyHighlight</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>const std::string &amp;</type>
          <declname>text</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>const std::vector&lt; std::pair&lt; size_t, size_t &gt; &gt; &amp;</type>
          <declname>offsets</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>const std::string &amp;</type>
          <declname>open_tag</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>const std::string &amp;</type>
          <declname>close_tag</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Apply highlight tags at the given byte <computeroutput>offsets</computeroutput> inside <computeroutput>text</computeroutput>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><computeroutput>offsets</computeroutput> is a list of [start, end) byte pairs describing the byte ranges to wrap. Ranges must be non-overlapping and sorted by start.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>text</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Source text. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>offsets</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Sorted, non-overlapping [start,end) byte ranges. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>open_tag</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Opening highlight tag. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>close_tag</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Closing highlight tag. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><computeroutput>text</computeroutput> with tags inserted at the specified ranges. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
